00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.000
David Mendenhall: Hold on, hold on.

224
00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:12.400
David Mendenhall: What's going on?

225
00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:12.960
David Mendenhall: Why are these?

226
00:20:15.759 --> 00:20:16.080
Kostadis Roussos: Hold on.

227
00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:17.040
Kostadis Roussos: Vukradin.

228
00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:18.160
Kostadis Roussos: How do I pronounce your name?

229
00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:20.960
Kostadis Roussos: Is it Vukradin, Vukradin, Vukradin?

230
00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.800
David Mendenhall: I think Vukradin.

231
00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:23.840
Wade Brown: Or V Dog.

232
00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:24.880
Wade Brown: Just call him V Dog.

233
00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:25.920
Kostadis Roussos: Like, does anybody?

234
00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:26.880
Kostadis Roussos: Let me ask you a question.

235
00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:31.440
Kostadis Roussos: Does anyone other than your mother and your stalwart fans call you Vukradin?

236
00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:36.640
Kostadis Roussos: Doesn't anybody use like a nickname like Din or Krad or Vuk?

237
00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.720
David Mendenhall: I'm a serious musician.

238
00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.680
David Mendenhall: Did you use my name?

239
00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.840
David Mendenhall: I don't know what you think is going on here.

240
00:20:54.589 --> 00:20:55.869
David Mendenhall: Vukradin will be fine.

241
00:20:56.029 --> 00:20:56.589
David Mendenhall: Thank you.

242
00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:57.230
Kostadis Roussos: Okay.

243
00:20:59.549 --> 00:21:01.470
Kostadis Roussos: Do your friends call you Kasadoporium?

244
00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:01.789
Kostadis Roussos: Yes.

245
00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:02.750
Kostadis Roussos: Are they your friends?

246
00:21:03.069 --> 00:21:03.390
Kostadis Roussos: No.

247
00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.589
David Mendenhall: He answers, what friends?

248
00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:07.470
David Mendenhall: Exactly.

249
00:21:08.109 --> 00:21:09.150
Kostadis Roussos: Are they your friends?

250
00:21:10.349 --> 00:21:10.670
David Mendenhall: No.

251
00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.150
Wade Brown: For what it's worth, we can barely see the orcs.

252
00:21:13.309 --> 00:21:14.509
Wade Brown: We can see maybe like two of them.

253
00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.589
Wade Brown: The rest are kind of up here in the fog of war or something.

254
00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:17.710
David Mendenhall: I'm going first.

255
00:21:17.869 --> 00:21:20.430
David Mendenhall: This is very bad for the party that I'm going first.

256
00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:24.029
David Mendenhall: I would like to parlay with the orcs.

257
00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:24.910
Kostadis Roussos: Okay.

258
00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:28.109
Kostadis Roussos: Do you actually walk up to them and say, I wish to party?

259
00:21:28.349 --> 00:21:29.309
David Mendenhall: Sadly, yes.

260
00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.190
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

261
00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:30.750
Kostadis Roussos: Well.

262
00:21:31.069 --> 00:21:33.150
Wade Brown: Oh, that boy's going to get himself killed.

263
00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:35.390
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

264
00:21:35.549 --> 00:21:42.029
Kostadis Roussos: Well, the orcs kind of say the orcs are kind of like, cool.

265
00:21:42.349 --> 00:21:43.630
Kostadis Roussos: He's a dumbass.

266
00:21:44.829 --> 00:21:52.109
Kostadis Roussos: Actually, what they really say is, he recognizes our rights to this territory and is offering himself in sacrifice.

267
00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:53.309
David Mendenhall: Sacrifice?

268
00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:54.589
David Mendenhall: No, I just wanted to talk.

269
00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:55.309
David Mendenhall: What is going on?

270
00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:56.349
David Mendenhall: Why are you guys here?

271
00:21:56.509 --> 00:21:57.789
David Mendenhall: Like, did you need something?

272
00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:58.670
David Mendenhall: Do you need help?

273
00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:01.150
David Mendenhall: Like, are you looking for a place to stay?

274
00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:03.869
David Mendenhall: Like, are you hungry?

275
00:22:06.829 --> 00:22:07.230
Wade Brown: Well, hold on.

276
00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:09.710
Wade Brown: Do you offer to fluff their pillows while you're at it?

277
00:22:12.589 --> 00:22:14.269
David Mendenhall: I've never encountered orcs before.

278
00:22:14.349 --> 00:22:15.710
David Mendenhall: I'm very confused.

279
00:22:16.349 --> 00:22:17.309
Kostadis Roussos: Actually, it's worse than that.

280
00:22:17.470 --> 00:22:25.069
Kostadis Roussos: You have encountered orcs before, but they were in whatchamacallit Storm King's.

281
00:22:25.230 --> 00:22:25.870
Kostadis Roussos: No, no, no.

282
00:22:26.269 --> 00:22:28.910
Kostadis Roussos: They were in Neverwinter and they were civilized.

283
00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:30.190
David Mendenhall: Oh, even better.

284
00:22:30.349 --> 00:22:30.910
David Mendenhall: There you go.

285
00:22:31.789 --> 00:22:33.630
David Mendenhall: And even doubly confusing.

286
00:22:34.269 --> 00:22:35.710
David Mendenhall: You came and listened to my music.

287
00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:36.109
Kostadis Roussos: Yes.

288
00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:38.349
David Mendenhall: Do you need me to play for you?

289
00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:41.549
David Mendenhall: I don't have my piano with me, but I have a trumpet.

290
00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:44.349
Gary Young: You said a trumpet?

291
00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:46.109
David Mendenhall: Yeah, a trumpet.

292
00:22:46.589 --> 00:22:46.990
Gary Young: He said some.

293
00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:48.430
David Mendenhall: I also have a clarinet.

294
00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:49.549
David Mendenhall: Would you prefer that?

295
00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:52.430
David Mendenhall: Do you want the reeded instrument or just the brass?

296
00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:53.870
Wade Brown: So I don't understand any of this.

297
00:22:54.029 --> 00:22:54.190
Wade Brown: Right.

298
00:22:54.269 --> 00:22:55.230
Wade Brown: He's speaking in orc.

299
00:22:56.269 --> 00:22:56.670
Kostadis Roussos: Let me see.

300
00:22:57.069 --> 00:22:58.670
Wade Brown: Clarinet is more appropriate for them.

301
00:22:58.910 --> 00:22:59.950
Kostadis Roussos: They speak common in orc.

302
00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:01.549
David Mendenhall: Common.

303
00:23:01.870 --> 00:23:02.430
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

304
00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:06.750
Kostadis Roussos: So, all right.

305
00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:09.309
Kostadis Roussos: So he moves over here.

306
00:23:10.349 --> 00:23:10.750
Kostadis Roussos: Sorry.

307
00:23:11.389 --> 00:23:12.430
David Mendenhall: And whacks me.

308
00:23:13.069 --> 00:23:13.470
Kostadis Roussos: Hold on.

309
00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:14.509
Kostadis Roussos: Orc number one.

310
00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:14.829
Kostadis Roussos: Sorry.

311
00:23:14.990 --> 00:23:18.670
Kostadis Roussos: Orc number one kind of is like whack.

312
00:23:19.309 --> 00:23:23.150
Kostadis Roussos: Well, if you're going to give us a bonus round, we're going to take advantage of it.

313
00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:31.710
Kostadis Roussos: And he reaches with his great axe, and Effen misses, proving that God loves fools and sinners.

314
00:23:32.349 --> 00:23:33.230
David Mendenhall: All right, you missed.

315
00:23:33.309 --> 00:23:33.470
David Mendenhall: Great.

316
00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:33.789
David Mendenhall: All right.

317
00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:35.230
David Mendenhall: The battle is joined then.

318
00:23:35.309 --> 00:23:36.190
David Mendenhall: All right, Soma.

319
00:23:36.269 --> 00:23:37.470
David Mendenhall: Don't be an idiot like me.

320
00:23:37.789 --> 00:23:38.990
Wade Brown: You got lucky, kiddo.

321
00:23:39.309 --> 00:23:39.869
David Mendenhall: I did.

322
00:23:43.869 --> 00:23:52.349
Kostadis Roussos: This is where one of you remembers that there were orc tribes that were coming down from the north.

323
00:23:53.309 --> 00:23:56.670
David Mendenhall: We were told this by the mayor of the town or something.

324
00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.029
Kostadis Roussos: No, the innkeeper.

325
00:23:58.190 --> 00:23:59.069
David Mendenhall: The innkeeper.

326
00:23:59.230 --> 00:23:59.470
David Mendenhall: All right.

327
00:24:00.670 --> 00:24:01.069
Wade Brown: All right.

328
00:24:01.470 --> 00:24:05.710
Wade Brown: We're going to go ahead and cast Ice Knife on number three.

329
00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:07.230
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

330
00:24:07.549 --> 00:24:08.190
Wade Brown: Let's see.

331
00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:10.430
Wade Brown: Actually, how high up are they?

332
00:24:11.789 --> 00:24:13.230
Wade Brown: This is an incline, right?

333
00:24:13.549 --> 00:24:14.190
Kostadis Roussos: Yes.

334
00:24:14.829 --> 00:24:16.269
Kostadis Roussos: 20 feet.

335
00:24:17.230 --> 00:24:17.549
Wade Brown: Okay.

336
00:24:17.789 --> 00:24:23.309
Wade Brown: So theoretically, if I thorn-whipped a guy down, would he end up on like prone and take damage on the way down?

337
00:24:25.869 --> 00:24:26.829
Kostadis Roussos: Yeah, I guess so.

338
00:24:27.470 --> 00:24:28.829
Wade Brown: All right, then maybe that's what we do.

339
00:24:28.990 --> 00:24:31.869
Wade Brown: We're just going to thorn whip number two and drag him down.

340
00:24:32.190 --> 00:24:34.029
Kostadis Roussos: All right, what's the saving throw or is it a two-hit?

341
00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:35.710
Wade Brown: That's me.

342
00:24:38.539 --> 00:24:39.259
Wade Brown: Five points.

343
00:24:39.579 --> 00:24:40.700
David Mendenhall: 22 hits.

344
00:24:41.019 --> 00:24:41.500
Kostadis Roussos: Yep.

345
00:24:41.819 --> 00:24:42.940
Wade Brown: It's a hit.

346
00:24:43.740 --> 00:24:44.700
Wade Brown: Falls down.

347
00:24:45.339 --> 00:24:46.940
Wade Brown: Yeah, he gets dragged.

348
00:24:47.019 --> 00:24:47.339
Wade Brown: Let's see.

349
00:24:47.419 --> 00:24:53.419
Wade Brown: On a hit, the target takes 1d6 and then pull it 10 feet closer, which means he tumbles down the hill.

350
00:24:53.659 --> 00:24:55.339
Wade Brown: I assume that knocks him prone or something crazy.

351
00:24:56.059 --> 00:24:57.180
David Mendenhall: You should bring him another five feet.

352
00:24:57.339 --> 00:24:59.579
Kostadis Roussos: No, no, I'm assuming this was 20 feet down.

353
00:24:59.899 --> 00:25:00.460
David Mendenhall: Oh, I see.

354
00:25:00.619 --> 00:25:00.940
David Mendenhall: I see.

355
00:25:01.099 --> 00:25:01.339
David Mendenhall: Okay.

356
00:25:01.659 --> 00:25:01.899
Kostadis Roussos: Right.

357
00:25:02.139 --> 00:25:02.379
Kostadis Roussos: Okay.

358
00:25:02.940 --> 00:25:05.980
Kostadis Roussos: So does he take fall damage?

359
00:25:06.299 --> 00:25:07.980
Wade Brown: At the very least, he should be prone or something.

360
00:25:08.220 --> 00:25:09.099
Kostadis Roussos: No, no, he's definitely prone.

361
00:25:09.419 --> 00:25:09.740
Kostadis Roussos: Okay, good.

362
00:25:10.139 --> 00:25:13.180
Kostadis Roussos: I'm saying, I'm trying to decide if he takes fall damage because he was rolled down.

363
00:25:19.190 --> 00:25:20.390
Kostadis Roussos: Does he take prone damage?

364
00:25:20.470 --> 00:25:21.750
Kostadis Roussos: Does he take fall damage?

365
00:25:22.150 --> 00:25:23.750
Kostadis Roussos: Takes 1d6 worth of fall damage.

366
00:25:23.910 --> 00:25:24.230
Kostadis Roussos: How about that?

367
00:25:24.869 --> 00:25:25.190
Kostadis Roussos: That's a cost.

368
00:25:25.430 --> 00:25:26.069
Kostadis Roussos: That's good enough.

369
00:25:26.390 --> 00:25:27.029
Kostadis Roussos: That works.

370
00:25:27.269 --> 00:25:27.670
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

371
00:25:28.630 --> 00:25:30.230
Kostadis Roussos: Doesn't take the full 2d6.

372
00:25:30.309 --> 00:25:31.910
Kostadis Roussos: That's what I was trying to decide.

373
00:25:32.549 --> 00:25:32.950
Wade Brown: All right.

374
00:25:33.029 --> 00:25:34.309
Wade Brown: He takes one more.

375
00:25:34.630 --> 00:25:35.829
Kostadis Roussos: So, six points of damage?

376
00:25:36.069 --> 00:25:38.309
Wade Brown: Six points on orc number two.

377
00:25:39.349 --> 00:25:41.269
Wade Brown: The important thing is he is CC'd.

378
00:25:43.349 --> 00:25:44.309
Wade Brown: Init bonus.

379
00:25:44.549 --> 00:25:45.349
Wade Brown: Somebody already got him.

380
00:25:45.430 --> 00:25:45.670
Wade Brown: Good.

381
00:25:45.750 --> 00:25:46.150
Wade Brown: Thank you.

382
00:25:46.710 --> 00:25:47.109
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

383
00:25:48.069 --> 00:25:48.390
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

384
00:25:48.470 --> 00:25:48.869
Kostadis Roussos: Who's next?

385
00:25:49.109 --> 00:25:49.670
David Mendenhall: Orc four.

386
00:25:53.420 --> 00:25:53.980
Kostadis Roussos: Or four.

387
00:25:54.779 --> 00:25:55.500
Kostadis Roussos: Is that what I heard?

388
00:25:55.900 --> 00:25:56.620
Wade Brown: We heard orc four.

389
00:25:57.500 --> 00:25:57.660
Kostadis Roussos: Okay.

390
00:25:58.140 --> 00:25:58.700
Kostadis Roussos: Orc four.

391
00:25:59.980 --> 00:26:00.299
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

392
00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:02.220
Kostadis Roussos: I'm currently futzing with technology.

393
00:26:02.380 --> 00:26:03.900
Kostadis Roussos: That is not a good thing for me to be doing.

394
00:26:04.460 --> 00:26:08.299
Kostadis Roussos: I should be focused on playing and not on, you know, goofing off with technology.

395
00:26:08.620 --> 00:26:13.100
Kostadis Roussos: Because we all know that technology is, in fact, the source of all problems in modern society.

396
00:26:13.340 --> 00:26:14.380
Wade Brown: No, it's PMs.

397
00:26:15.900 --> 00:26:19.019
Kostadis Roussos: Well, since we have none here anymore, I suppose we could say that.

398
00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:21.500
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

399
00:26:21.660 --> 00:26:22.460
Kostadis Roussos: So you did that.

400
00:26:22.620 --> 00:26:23.740
Kostadis Roussos: What does number four do?

401
00:26:24.700 --> 00:26:25.019
Kostadis Roussos: Okay.

402
00:26:27.900 --> 00:26:30.140
Kostadis Roussos: So he can move.

403
00:26:30.460 --> 00:26:31.100
Kostadis Roussos: So he does.

404
00:26:31.340 --> 00:26:31.740
Kostadis Roussos: One.

405
00:26:33.019 --> 00:26:36.140
Kostadis Roussos: One, two, three.

406
00:26:37.740 --> 00:26:39.180
Kostadis Roussos: And he's like, whatever.

407
00:26:42.059 --> 00:26:44.940
Kostadis Roussos: And he will attack Kraden again.

408
00:26:45.180 --> 00:26:45.420
Kostadis Roussos: Why?

409
00:26:45.580 --> 00:26:47.820
Kostadis Roussos: Because he happens to be closest.

410
00:26:48.460 --> 00:26:50.140
Wade Brown: I mean, he did rush up into the front.

411
00:26:50.460 --> 00:26:51.100
Kostadis Roussos: Yeah, he did.

412
00:26:51.259 --> 00:26:54.299
Kostadis Roussos: So it's not my fault.

413
00:26:56.460 --> 00:26:58.059
Kostadis Roussos: Except I forgot to roll to hit.

414
00:27:01.250 --> 00:27:01.730
Kostadis Roussos: 18.

415
00:27:01.809 --> 00:27:03.569
Kostadis Roussos: You take 12 points of damage, Vukradin.

416
00:27:03.970 --> 00:27:05.569
David Mendenhall: I am unconscious.

417
00:27:05.889 --> 00:27:07.170
Kostadis Roussos: You are unconscious.

418
00:27:07.490 --> 00:27:07.809
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

419
00:27:08.129 --> 00:27:09.889
David Mendenhall: And let me do my death save.

420
00:27:10.210 --> 00:27:10.849
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

421
00:27:13.409 --> 00:27:14.289
Kostadis Roussos: Who's next?

422
00:27:14.609 --> 00:27:15.490
David Mendenhall: I failed.

423
00:27:15.809 --> 00:27:16.210
Kostadis Roussos: All right.

424
00:27:16.529 --> 00:27:17.329
Gary Young: I think it's me.

425
00:27:17.569 --> 00:27:20.129
David Mendenhall: It's going to be a very painful lesson that I learned.

426
00:27:20.450 --> 00:27:22.210
Wade Brown: Or maybe you won't learn anything.

427
00:27:22.529 --> 00:27:23.250
Wade Brown: You'll just be dead.

428
00:27:23.569 --> 00:27:24.769
David Mendenhall: I'll just be dead.

429
00:27:25.409 --> 00:27:25.889
David Mendenhall: Even better.

430
00:27:27.170 --> 00:27:27.809
Gary Young: All right.

431
00:27:28.129 --> 00:27:28.369
Gary Young: All right.

432
00:27:28.529 --> 00:27:34.529
Gary Young: We'll go with heal the word, healing word, and then Sacred Flame.

433
00:27:35.089 --> 00:27:35.490
David Mendenhall: All right.

434
00:27:35.730 --> 00:27:37.730
David Mendenhall: You got 11 on a healing word?

435
00:27:37.970 --> 00:27:39.569
David Mendenhall: I didn't even know it could be that powerful.

436
00:27:39.889 --> 00:27:41.250
David Mendenhall: I thought it was like a d4.

437
00:27:41.649 --> 00:27:42.529
David Mendenhall: It's 2d4.

438
00:27:42.849 --> 00:27:43.490
Gary Young: I believe I have some.

439
00:27:43.889 --> 00:27:45.649
Wade Brown: It says 2d4 plus 3 in the.

440
00:27:46.210 --> 00:27:47.089
Wade Brown: He double crit.

441
00:27:47.809 --> 00:27:48.609
David Mendenhall: Wow, nice.

442
00:27:48.929 --> 00:27:49.250
David Mendenhall: All right.

443
00:27:49.409 --> 00:27:50.529
David Mendenhall: So I have nine hit points.

444
00:27:50.609 --> 00:27:50.849
David Mendenhall: Thank you.

445
00:27:51.089 --> 00:27:53.250
Gary Young: And one point in Sacred Flame.

446
00:27:53.889 --> 00:27:54.529
Gary Young: To whom?

447
00:27:55.649 --> 00:27:56.450
Gary Young: We're going to go with.

448
00:27:59.089 --> 00:28:00.289
Gary Young: Actually, that's a good question.

449
00:28:01.329 --> 00:28:01.730
Gary Young: Hold on.

450
00:28:01.809 --> 00:28:03.089
Gary Young: Prone condition.

451
00:28:06.099 --> 00:28:08.019
Gary Young: Why is Brewberry injured?

452
00:28:08.339 --> 00:28:09.220
Gary Young: Didn't we do a long rest?

453
00:28:09.539 --> 00:28:10.180
David Mendenhall: Do long rest.

454
00:28:10.500 --> 00:28:10.980
David Mendenhall: Yeah, yeah, yeah.

455
00:28:11.700 --> 00:28:12.980
